# Graphics API parity (live canvas)

A static scene exercising the portable WCHNTGraphics surface. The same
drawing appears in `examples/graphics_openfl.wcn`; both hosts use identical
calls so the visual result matches.

- `background` sets the clear colour; `clear` paints it.
- `beginFill` fills; `lineStyle` strokes; `noStroke` clears the stroke.
- `drawRect` / `drawCircle` / `drawEllipse` fill **and** stroke when both are set.
- `drawLine` strokes only.
- `moveTo` / `lineTo` … `endFill` draw a filled/stroked polygon path.

## Schema

```
Game = Int/w Int/h
```

## Construction

```
[:Game 800 600]
```

## Target

```
%canvas

%init
var assemblage;

function init() {
    assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory();
}

%step
function step() {
    wchntGraphics.background(0x1a1a2e);
    wchntGraphics.clear();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0x2a2a2a);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(20, 20, 160, 100);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.lineStyle(2, 0x00ff00);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(200, 20, 160, 100);
    wchntGraphics.noStroke();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0xf2f2f2);
    wchntGraphics.drawCircle(100, 200, 40);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.lineStyle(3, 0xff6464);
    wchntGraphics.drawCircle(260, 200, 40);
    wchntGraphics.noStroke();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0x6464ff);
    wchntGraphics.lineStyle(2, 0xffffff);
    wchntGraphics.drawEllipse(420, 200, 60, 30);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.noStroke();
    wchntGraphics.lineStyle(4, 0xffffff);
    wchntGraphics.drawLine(20, 300, 760, 300);
    wchntGraphics.noStroke();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0xc8c864);
    wchntGraphics.moveTo(100, 400);
    wchntGraphics.lineTo(200, 340);
    wchntGraphics.lineTo(300, 400);
    wchntGraphics.lineTo(100, 400);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
}
```
